Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 15:55:49 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] GNOME 50 support: metadata, null guards, GTK4/libadwaita
 prefs layout

Applies PR #169 (ykiryeyev:Gome50_update) with two deviations:
- Skips autothemes.js, which changes auto-theme foreground selection
  behaviour (forces autofg-bar/autofg-menu off) rather than fixing GNOME 50
  compatibility, and whose getBestContrastColor fallback is unreachable
  (contrast ratio can never be < 1.0).
- Keeps the existing local 'position' variable in updatePanelStyle instead
  of switching to 'this.position', which is undefined and would have pinned
  notification banners to the top.
